    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "WESTERN",
      "QUEEN OF THE WESTERN AIRLINES FLEET IS\nTHE DC-6B—symbol of air service in the West.\nCarrying 60 passengers in super-pressurized,\nfour-engine comfort, Western's DC-6Bs fly\nthe Routes of the CALIFORNIAN, famed\n\"champagne and orchids\" flights between all major Pacific\nCoast cities and between Los Angeles, Salt Lake City and\nMinneapolis/St. Paul.\nWESTERN AIRLINES • AMERICA'S SENIOR AIRLINE\nUSE\nAIR\nMAIL\nPOST CARD\n2015.1661731"
    ],
